	(text "04 Measurement, digitised on this board (the 40-pin is isolated on the control board, so analog lines can't cross it): 4 voltages (1/200, 0-500 V into 2.5 V) and 4 shunt currents (1 V/A around 1.25 V, +-1.25 A), MCP6004 buffers, AD7689 8-channel 16-bit 250 kSPS SPI ADC (internal 2.5 V reference). ADC channel order mirrors v2's J1 pads 1-8."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
